"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/western-philosophy-history/contemporary-western/analytic-philosophy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"postmodernism-philosophy","title":"后现代哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/western-philosophy-history/contemporary-western/postmodernism-philosophy"}]}]}